    "This seven-file future delta has not been applied, compiled, tested or accepted. The current integrated140 boundary still uses exactly the unchanged chapter85f1f590 canonical source.",
    "Root review and actual selected Swift SDK execution are required for the new writer/host behavior. The protected-copy write ordering changes default App metadata and needs the additional 10 existing metadata/publish/recovery methods, not merely helper grammar.",
    "Legacy synchronous import/sync apply APIs still wait on the existing persist queue. Their new active-owner encoded payload merge must be reviewed for caller latency; this delta does not claim whole-App main-thread blocking is eliminated.",
    "Preview OnlineBook.id/currentBook variables are an existing App owner but are not bound to the original host. Unknown book URLs do not obtain fabricated shelf UUIDs.",
    "Full Cookie rich metadata and mutations shared with CookieStore/HTTPCookieStorage, plus atomic login-header Cookie side effects, remain typed unsupported.",
    "The normal traditional-source BookSourceFetcher/App service still does not request these grants or select sourceMode original-traditional. Body no-save results are not yet returned through the existing Pipeline/ChapterCacheRepository product route.",
    "The ordinary JAR -> JNI -> actual native App reading chain and real manager grant lifecycle have not executed. Source-only Package/SDK checks are not that product acceptance."
